      "sc:description": "PEPE is a high-throughput, streaming-based command-line tool designed for the efficient, scalable extraction of diverse, multi-modal representations (embeddings) from Protein Language Models (PLMs). It enables researchers to generate massive datasets of protein embeddings for downstream structural, functional, and evolutionary analyses.",
